SOAPBOX: I decided last week that I was going to put in an entry just on 15m because it's my favourite band but oh my, conditions have been absolutely terrible.  The band started off flat and didn't really change much.  The QSB made signals come and go like nothing I've seen before, from +10 to unreadable in just a couple of minutes.  Almost every QSO was a struggle.
SOAPBOX: There was no point in trying to make any contacts using FT4, I didn't see a single signal on that section of the band.
